minimize the amount of steps

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.160
without locking people in and
keeping Kubernetes as open

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.119
as it is.

00:18:35.119 --> 00:18:36.785
MARK MANDEL: That's
fantastic, actually.

00:18:36.785 --> 00:18:39.899
I didn't realize that SIG
