00:18:39.899 --> 00:18:41.690
CARTER MORGAN: Yeah,
it just got started up

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:43.231
within the last month, I think.

00:18:43.231 --> 00:18:44.480
MARK MANDEL: No, that's great.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.397
That has been a common
