00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.660
because it's too hard to--

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.760
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, OK.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:08.907
CARTER MORGAN: But no, the steps
